{"id":1253,"date":"2026-08-21T16:56:41","date_gmt":"2026-08-21T16:56:41","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1253"},"modified":"2026-08-22T01:04:13","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T01:04:13","slug":"coupon-templates","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/marketing\/coupon-templates\/","title":{"rendered":"Coupon Templates"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Coupon Templates<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1257\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-013402.png\" alt=\"Inserting a Coupon\" width=\"266\" height=\"311\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-013402.png 558w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-013402-256x300.png 256w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 266px) 100vw, 266px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher includes a dedicated suite of marketing and promotional tools accessible from the <strong>Insert<\/strong> ribbon, all designed to produce print-ready content that renders perfectly in PDF and physical print output. The Coupon insertion tool provides a library of 12 distinct, fully designed templates in a compact 3-column gallery.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Inserting a Coupon<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To insert a coupon:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>Insert &gt; Coupon<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The Coupon gallery opens showing all 12 template options.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click a template to insert it onto the canvas.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Edit the text, prices, and details by clicking into the text blocks.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Available Templates<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1260\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-014453.png\" alt=\"Available Templates\" width=\"515\" height=\"315\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-014453.png 1132w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-014453-300x183.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-014453-1024x625.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-014453-768x469.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 515px) 100vw, 515px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Buy 1 Get 1 Free (BOGO) &#8211;<\/strong> Uses custom high-density PNG barcode rendering.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Gift Voucher &#8211;<\/strong> Classic bordered certificate style.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Flash Sale &#8211;<\/strong> High-contrast, attention-grabbing block for urgent promotions.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Loyalty Card &#8211;<\/strong> \u201cBuy 4 Get 1 Free\u201d graphical punch card.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>VIP Pass &#8211;<\/strong> Elegant gold and black styling for premium admissions.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Free Drink &#8211;<\/strong> Warm, coffee-shop aesthetic.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Promo Code &#8211;<\/strong> Clean blue e-commerce style discount block.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Event Ticket &#8211;<\/strong> Realistic rotated stub design, engineered with native HTML tables to prevent structural collapse during print rendering.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Store Credit &#8211;<\/strong> Simple, high-visibility cash value voucher.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Raffle Ticket &#8211;<\/strong> Split-design ticket with a perforated-style tear-off section.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Barcode Print Safety<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1264\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/barcodes.webp\" alt=\"Barcode Print Safety\" width=\"78\" height=\"86\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/barcodes.webp 416w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/barcodes-272x300.webp 272w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 78px) 100vw, 78px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">All barcode generation in coupon templates bypasses CSS structural layouts entirely. Barcodes are drawn to an off-screen HTML5 Canvas and exported as a single flat PNG, preventing print engines from stripping backgrounds or shifting elements during PDF export.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Coupon Templates Open Publisher includes a dedicated suite of marketing and promotional tools accessible from the Insert ribbon, all designed to produce print-ready content that renders perfectly in PDF and physical print output. The Coupon insertion tool provides a library of 12 distinct, fully designed templates in a compact 3-column gallery. Inserting a Coupon To [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1267,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[19],"class_list":["post-1253","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-marketing"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1253","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1253"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1253\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1269,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1253\/revisions\/1269"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1267"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1253"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1253"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}